<title>RUSSIA: WEATHER - Conditions at CIS airports - Jan 21.</title>
<headline>WEATHER - Conditions at CIS airports - Jan 21.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Airports in the Murmansk and Arkhangelsk regions of northern Russia may be closed on January 21 due to strong winds and heavy snowstorms, the Russian Weather Service said on Monday.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom +7095 941 8520</p>
